90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、赋值与满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(A\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span> 时同一函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\\)</span> 也作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 的赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\preccurlyeq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n[(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\beta])].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\preccurlyeq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n[(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\beta])].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>完整赋值形式避免把自由变量数 n 留成不随量化公式变化的游离参数；与原本意欲表达的带参数初等性一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]"